 "behavior": "patrols the room with walk; at the end of a room (or every ~4s) plays search. Walks to the nearest toy in her beam and plays pickup. If the beam touches a kid who is NOT on a hide = true tile: play spot, show fx_spotted over the kid, -5s. A kid landing on her head: play stunned for 2s (beam off), +5s, bounce the kid up (vy -380px/s).",
 "level": {
  "timeSec": 50,
  "totalToys": 30,
  "kidPlayers": 1,
  "kidChoice": [
   "konstantin",
   "katarina",
   "vasilije",
   "dimitrije"
  ],
  "spottedPenaltySec": 5,
  "spottedLine": "Aha!",
  "headStompBonusSec": 5,
  "stunSec": 2,
  "win": "when the timer reaches 0 or no toys are left, the kid wins if kidToys > sackToys; otherwise the level restarts",
  "onWin": "Marija joins as a playable hero (sprites/heroes/kids/marija)",
